">Kaykhusraw I</a> captures the port of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/antalya">Antalya</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1221</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kayqubad-i">Kayqubad I</a> takes <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/alanya">Alanya</a> and fortifies it</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1243</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mongols">Mongols</a> crush the Seljuk army at the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-kose-dag">Battle of Köse Dağ</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1273</span><span class="rf-text">The poet and mystic <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rumi">Rumi</a> dies in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/konya">Konya</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">c. 1308</span><span class="rf-text">The last sultan, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mesud-ii">Mesud II</a>, dies and the sultanate lapses</span></li></ol>
